{"title":"Vanguard Captain Mhorsk","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Vanguard Captain Mhorsk is a guard — a named <a href=\"#/monster/thak-footman\">Thak Footman</a> seen at level 40.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find Vanguard Captain Mhorsk</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Thak%20Vanguard%20Camp\">Thak Vanguard Camp</a></li></ul>\n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"vanguard-captain-mhorsk\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"black-walnut-staff\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/ebc76f546f7e78794d2e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Black Walnut Staff</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">3 drops</span></div></div></div>\n      <h2>Other named Thak Footmans</h2><p><a href=\"#/npc/thak-vanguard\">Thak Vanguard</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/thak-scout\">Thak Scout</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/scout-captain-drel\">Scout-Captain Drel</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/scout-warden-ushk\">Scout Warden Ushk</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/943cc0a6e8d1aa9dd0bd.webp\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>Vanguard Captain Mhorsk</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/thak-footman\">Thak Footman</a></td></tr><tr><th>Role</th><td>guard</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>40</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>582</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>40 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}